<p>Fire a charged shot at the farthest target with your tail-mounted steamgun that pierces through your enemies, ignoring armor and dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">178%, 202%, 220%, 236%, 250%</acronym> weapon damage as lightning.</p><p>This takes no time to use.</p>